# The React client does not read local dataset files.
# Published data is fetched at runtime through Cloudflare Pages Functions.
#
# No client-side environment variable is required for datasets.
#
# For local development, create a root .dev.vars file so the local API server
# can read the R2 bucket:
#   R2_ACCOUNT_ID=...
#   R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
#   R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
#   R2_BUCKET_NAME=sc-craft-game-data-dev
